1. Objective and ending
Single player.
Play up to 3 cycles.
Lose immediately when Light reaches 0, including during fog payment or wraith conversion.
The Mother and Child quest is optional. Its reward helps the player, but completing it is not required to win.
Win condition: Endless survival. Souls will never run out, always shuffled back when run out.
2. Setup, arrivals and character values
Start with 6 Light, 4 ordinary passenger seats, 0 memories, and all anger counters at 0.
The initial shore contains Mother, Child, Merchant, Mason and Cook. Shuffle Soldier, Poet and Keeper into the arrival supply.
After each return, resolve Shore Anger first. Then draw ordinary souls until 5 are waiting, or the supply is empty. Delivered ordinary souls and ordinary souls that become wraiths never return.
