4. Forced tainted arrivals and full boats
A PoLong boards at the start of global outward rounds 3, 6, 9, 12, and so on.
The round counter continues across cycles. Boarding, returning and instant delivery do not advance it.
Resolve the optional memory first, then add the scheduled PoLong before travel. If an instant delivery empties the boat, return immediately instead of starting that outward round.
PoLong uses 0 seats, so it can attach to a full boat without removing another passenger. It cannot be refused. It follows ordinary preferred-destination and Ship Anger rules, with its additional fog effect.
