6. Memory rules and exact effects
Start with no memories.
Play at most 1 memory before each outward round or return.
Each memory is single-use and leaves the game after use.
Unused memories persist between cycles.
Hold at most 3 memories. After receiving rewards,choose to discard any when excess.
A newly earned memory becomes usable before a later round or return.
Rewards cannot rescue a player who already reached 0 Light while arriving.
