Ship Anger has a higher limit because it goes up much more often: every round instead of every cycle.
Quests
Some souls have a quest. Completing it gives you a special memory, which is stronger than a normal one.
Tainted souls
Every 3 rounds, a tainted soul is placed on your boat, and you can't refuse it. It carries a debuff that stays active until it leaves your boat. Otherwise it works like any other soul: it has a preferred destination and gains Ship Anger.
